  Description: "COMPANION / COMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nHero and all companions gain
    5% weapon damage per talent. Applies while owned before later damage modifiers.\r\n\nSUPPORT
    WHILE OWNED\nCompanions / Damage: +2.5%\nCompanions / Movement speed: -0.5%\nTier
    1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE
    IN THE WAITING REALM\nA river-dweller taught fencing by a ferry captain, they
    were exiled for refusing a duel against a frightened passenger. They want to
    teach a form whose last lesson is lowering the sword. Their salute belongs to
    no recognised school.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nNo additional periodic personal passive.\r\n\nNamed
    talents count bodies and absorbed memories; their stated percentages are not
    multiplied by star level unless explicitly stated. Listed support modifiers scale
    separately at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: oddity, gauntlet, hide. Immortal. Weapon rolls
    on recruitment; two equal-species/equal-star bodies merge unless the talent
    forbids it."
